    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d11">

                <pb facs="0099" n="17" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg17"/>

                <head>Mr. Motley to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 95.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vienna,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 16, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your despatch No. 132, of date 21st of March, containing military
                    intelligence, especially concerning General Sheridan’s splendid successes, of
                    which the importance can scarcely, I think, be exaggerated.</p>
                <p>The details of General Sherman’s wonderful campaign reach us slowly, but are
                    studied with intense care, and it would be difficult for me to describe the
                    emotions of pride and patriotic exultation with which we follow the career of
                    this daring and most sagacious chieftain. Who can doubt that the cause of <pb
                        facs="0100" n="18" xml:id="pg18"/> civilization and of human freedom must
                    triumph under the guidance of such military genius as it now possesses?</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. LOTHROP MOTLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
